Verse 2
We praise the Lord, exalt His name
His praise is always on my lips
The humble hear it with rejoicing
We praise Him now, bow and submit

Chorus
Taste and see that the Lord is good
Taste and see that the Lord is good
Taste and see that the Lord is good
Blessed are those who take refuge in Him

